<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<p id="demoNarration" style="margin:0;font-size:10px;max-width:180px;color:#333">The dark-blue arrows sample the dipole field on a regular grid: they point radially outward around (0,0) and radially inward around (2,0), fading to dots far from both centers.</p>
